        "content_type": "text/html",
        "body": "<p>Dear Carmen,</p><p><br></p><p>I hope you are doing well. </p><p><br></p><p>My name is Sara from Avicenna. We've received your request for a meeting. Thank you for your interest in our product and also for sharing this information about your project with us. <span style=\"background-color: initial; color: var(--text-normal);\">This is very interesting research work and we'd be more than happy to be part of it.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: var(--text-normal);\"><br></span></p><p>We built Avicenna to allow researchers and clinicians to automate their research work including field deployment, data collection, and monitoring. We’ve created a <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1rybAJBtBibyXltSYMVPKwuI31pGEOKwBDi2kqlHEdKQ/edit?usp=sharing\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1rybAJBtBibyXltSYMVPKwuI31pGEOKwBDi2kqlHEdKQ/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">slide deck</a> to highlight some of the features of our product.</p><p><br></p><p>You can certainly implement your ESM study in Avicenna and send as many surveys as necessary during your study at your desired time.<br></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color:var(--text-normal);\">If</span><span style=\"color:var(--text-normal);\"> </span><span style=\"color:var(--text-normal);\">you</span><span style=\"color:var(--text-normal);\"> </span><span style=\"color:var(--text-normal);\">have any questions, please feel free to contact us, or the </span><a href=\"mailto:support@avicennaresearch.com\">support team</a><span style=\"color:var(--text-normal);\">.</span><span style=\"color:var(--text-normal);\"> </span><span style=\"color:var(--text-normal);\">You</span><span style=\"color:var(--text-normal);\"> </span><span style=\"color:var(--text-normal);\">can</span><span style=\"color:var(--text-normal);\"> </span><span style=\"color:var(--text-normal);\">also visit our </span><a href=\"https://learn.avicennaresearch.com/\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://learn.avicennaresearch.com/\" target=\"_blank\">support knowledge base</a><span style=\"color:var(--text-normal);\"> which provides helpful hints for the entire platform as well as our </span><a href=\"https://forum.avicennaresearch.com/\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://forum.avicennaresearch.com/\" target=\"_blank\">forum page</a><span style=\"color:var(--text-normal);\"> where other researchers share their questions and thoughts.</span><br></p><p><br></p><p>If you like, we can arrange a brief meeting to demo our product and discuss your project. Our calendar is shared <a href=\"https://calendar.app.google/f5oJWo7VrEwf6hb77\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://calendar.app.google/f5oJWo7VrEwf6hb77\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, <span style=\"color:var(--text-normal);\">and we have a flexible schedule from October 23rd onward.</span></p><p><br></p><p>Best,</p><p>Sara</p><div data-signature=\"true\" data-signature-id=\"4\">--<br>Avicenna Research (formerly Ethica Data)<br><div><div>4109 - 295 Adelaide St W, Toronto, ON M5V 0L4, Canada</div></div>\n<div>Email: sales@avicennaresearch.com - Web: <a href=\"https://avicennaresearch.com\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://avicennaresearch.com</a><br>--</div>\n</div>",
